OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree stalemate continues as
OL,4,AOrange Order and protesters meet NI
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FProtesters remain on the Garvaghy Road
OL,8,Fin Portadown and Orangemen at Drumcree
OL,9,Fchurch as the parade dispute continues.
OL,11,FThe main parties involved in the
OL,12,Fdispute in Northern Ireland are still
OL,13,Fin a stalemate, following a day of
OL,14,Fpolitical talks and heated exchanges at
OL,15,FStormont.
OL,17,FMembers of the Orange Order are still
OL,18,Fwaiting to begin a parade, which was
OL,19,Fdue to take place on Sunday, and walk
OL,20,Fdown the mainly-nationalist Garvaghy
OL,21,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
